[0.000, "o", "\u001b[38;2;92;112;104m│ \u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;2;92;112;104m│ 1. It's for a Rust project called \"Foo\"\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;2;92;112;104m│ 2. It has badges for Rust 1.85+ and MIT/Apache-2.0 license\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;2;92;112;104m│ 3. It has features including `async` (tokio support) and `full` (all features)\u001b[39m\r\n"]
