[0.058, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2B\u001b[29A\r\u001b[J✅ \u001b[1mCompiler error successfully introduced!\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\r\u001b[J\u001b[1mError Details:\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;92;112;104m- \u001b[1m\u001b[39mFile\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m: \u001b[38;2;143;188;176m/Users/josh/code/foo/src/lib.rs\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;92;112;104m- \u001b[1m\u001b[39mLine\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m: 34\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;92;112;104m- \u001b[1m\u001b[39mError Code\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m: E0308\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;92;112;104m- \u001b[1m\u001b[39mMessage\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m:\r\n\u001b[38;2;143;188;176mmismatched types\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;2;143;188;176mexpected `u64`, found `&str`\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe \u001b[38;2;143;188;176madd\u001b[39m function now tries to return a string literal (\u001b[38;2;143;188;176m\"this is a string, not a number\"\u001b[39m) instead of a \u001b[38;2;143;188;176mu64\u001b[39m, which causes \r\na type mismatch error. The function signature declares it returns \u001b[38;2;143;188;176mu64\u001b[39m, but the actual return value is \u001b[38;2;143;188;176m&str\u001b[39m.\r\n"]
