[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2B\u001b[29A\r\u001b[JThe sub-agent (\u001b[1mMR BOT BOT\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m) has analyzed the codebase. Here's what it found:\r\n\r\u001b[J\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;223;194;150m## What This Codebase Does\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mFoo\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m is a simple Rust calculator library template that demonstrates basic Rust patterns including error handling, documen\r\ntation, and testing.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;223;194;150m### Functionality Provided\u001b[0m\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;2;92;112;104m1. \u001b[38;2;143;188;176madd(left: u64, right: u64) -> u64\u001b[39m - A standalone function that adds two unsigned 64-bit integers.\r\n"]
